Package: iOrganoAssay
Type: Package
Title: iOrganoAssay Shiny Application for Mouse Intestinal Organoid Image Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Sung-Wook",
                  family = "Nam",
                  email = "nams@knu.ac.kr",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an interactive Shiny application (iOrganoAssay) for
    the analysis of mouse intestinal organoid (mIO) microscopy images and
    their associated morphometric metrics. The package bundles the Shiny
    app inside R, so that users can launch it directly from R/RStudio
    without copying or pasting any script.
